                                    <p style="margin:2px auto;margin-left:20px;">C.胶质瘤</p>
                                
                                    <p style="margin:2px auto;margin-left:20px;">D.硬膜外血肿</p>
                                
                                    <p style="margin:2px auto;margin-left:20px;">E.蛛网膜下腔出血</p>
                                
                                    
                                
                                    
                                
                                    
                                
                                    
                                
                                    
                                
                                    
                                
                                    
                                
                                    
                                
                                    
                                
                                    
                                
                                    
                                
                                    
                                
                                    
                                
                                    
                                
                                    
                                
                            
                        
                            
                                
                                <div style="margin-top:10px;">108.患儿，男，13岁。膝关节疼痛1年余，结合图像，最可能的诊断是<img src="http://tk.ipmph.com/exam/upload/img/0425fb3bdec84f0ab3db0ce239057a22.jpg" dataimg="0425fb3bdec84f0ab3db0ce239057a22.jpg" width="322" height="241"></div>
                                
